    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38034" root="لهث" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُهْثَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Thirst.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Fatigue.</i> (AA, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
The <i>red speck in a palm-leaf,</i> (K,) <i>which
you see when you split it.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُهَاثٌ</span>
[for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِهَاثٌ</span>, pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُهْثَةٌ</span>,] The <i>specks in palmleaves:</i> (Fr, K:) the <i>red specks in palm-leaves,
when they are split:</i> (Fr, TA:) accord. to rule,
it should be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِهَاثٌ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِقَاطٌ</span>. (K.)

